    "body": "> (I think this does not affect the service worker navigate() API as you cannot get to that cross-origin.)\r\n\r\nI am in the process of rewriting our Client.navigate() and I think I did hit some restrictions (not sure if this is same as Boris mentioned).  Specifically, if an https iframe with an https parent is navigated via Client.navigate(insecureURL) then the navigation is blocked due to mixed content restrictions.",
